turei_zahav.en:
(א) The ground is paved. For then we are not concerned for leveling bumps; and some permit — they hold that even on unpaved it is not psik reisha to level bumps; and some are stringent — they hold that on unpaved it is psik reisha, and they decreed paved on account of unpaved.<br>
<br>
(ב) That their fibers break. It is wondrous to me — for even if they break it is only destructive work and exempt;
